    "text": "H thurh godes geuu \u00e6nglelandes kyning, grete ealle mine bisceopes, & ealle mine eorles, & ealle mine\nAnd ic kythe eow th\u00e6t ic habbe heom geunnon th\u00e6t hi byon \u00e6lc thare lande wurthe the hi h\u00e6fdon on\nAnd saca, & socne, on strande, & on streame, on wudan, & on feldan, tolnes & teames, grithbreces &\nForstealles & infangenes thyofes, & flemene feormthe ofer hire agene m\u00e6nn binnan burgan & butan,\nAnd ic nelle th\u00e6t \u00e6nig man \u00e6nig thing th\u00e6r on tyo buton hi.\nAnd heore wicn\u00e6ras the hi hit bet\u00e6can willath, ne fr\u00e6ncisc ne \u00e6nglisc, for tham thingan the ic h\u00e6bbe\nEalswa eadword kyng & mim f\u00e6der \u00e6r h\u00e6fdon, & ic nelle gethafian th\u00e6t \u00e6nig man this to brece be\nGod eow gehealde.",
